      "body": "ACK fa704c5d3cafcd768982a02c48c7c7d96d667fa1\n\nSetting noban_tx_relay to these tests is correct and I also like the new more direct comment for noban_tx_relay.\n\nI compared execution time running locally `build/test/functional/test_runner.py -j=18 --randomseed=1` (median of 3):\n\nrpc_psbt.py 18s -> 4s\nmempool_accept_wtxid.py 4s -> 0s\nmempool_limit.py 8s ->  4s\nmempool_package_rbf.py 13s -> 4s\nmempool_persist.py 12s -> 3s\n\nAcummulated 1066s -> 1011s\nWall 76s -> 73s\n\nThis is a nice speed up :)",
